<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p2_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/774007> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s2> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/4a34b55686b9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#subject> <http://snomed.info/id/263352000> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s2> .
