<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p55_b15> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the muscles and structures in the neck region involved in speech and swallowing, including both suprahyoid and infrahyoid muscles, as well as other anatomical features like the hyoid bone and thyroid gland." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s2> .
