<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p70_b10> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the anatomical relationships between the kidneys, the abdominal aorta, the inferior vena cava, and parts of the digestive tract." <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s13> .
