<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p46_b3> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The illustration presents a profile view of the human head and neck, with the head facing left. The outer surface of the head is light gray, representing the skull. Muscles are prominently displayed in red, covering the face, neck, and part of the scalp, with fine lines indicating muscle fibers and different shades showing various layers. The eye socket, nose, and mouth are outlined but not detailed, and the ear is also outlined without internal detail. The background is plain white, highlighting the red muscles." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s10> .
