<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p7_b13> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The illustration is framed by a red border, with the mandible depicted in a light beige color featuring a smooth surface. The labels for the greater horn, lesser horn, and body are written in black text and positioned near their respective parts on the mandible. Curved red lines appear on the right side of the image, not connecting to any part of the mandible." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s6> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/bf3fd0e04ab2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s6> .
