<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p40_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure presents a table comparing the characteristics of direct (acquired) and indirect (congenital) inguinal hernias across five aspects: predisposing factors, frequency, coverings at exit from the abdominal cavity, course, and exit from the anterior abdominal wall." <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s12> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/37f07f9aeb75> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#subject> <http://snomed.info/id/396232000> <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s12> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p39_b8> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/15425007> <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s12> .
