<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p32_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "A histological section stained with hematoxylin and eosin (H&E) showing various labeled areas and tissue structures." <urn:graph:histology_endocrine/s1> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p25_b1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#FigureImage> <urn:graph:histology_endocrine/s1> .
