<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p24_b9> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "A histological section of the tongue's circumvallate papilla region, stained with hematoxylin and eosin (H&E), showing taste buds, circumvallate papilla, and serous glands." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s5> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p106_b7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#FigureImage> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s5> .
