<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p23_b9> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image displays a cross-sectional view of the tongue's surface, with the foliate papillae positioned at the top, appearing as elongated, finger-like structures. Between these papillae, taste buds are nestled in the grooves, appearing darker than the surrounding tissue. Serous glands, larger and more rounded, are situated below the ducts and taste buds. At the bottom, the striated muscle layer is visible, with muscle fibers arranged in a striated pattern." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s5> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/e34f553ca797> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#confidence> "0.9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s5> .
