<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p15_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The illustration presents a detailed view of the hard palate, which is roughly triangular in shape with the base at the front and the apex at the back. The soft palate is shown as an elongated structure extending from the back of the hard palate. On the left side of the hard palate, adjacent to the teeth, is the fatty zone, with the glandular zone situated below it. Each labeled element is connected by a black line to its corresponding anatomical feature, with labels placed around the periphery of the image." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s2> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p15_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/72914001> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s2> .
