<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p2_b4> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image displays a variety of cells scattered throughout, with no specific arrangement. Some cells are round with a darker nucleus and lighter cytoplasm, resembling red blood cells, while others have an irregular shape with a darker nucleus and granular cytoplasm, resembling white blood cells. The background has a purple hue with darker areas that might represent tissue or other cellular structures. There are no labels or text, nor any leader lines or arrows in the image." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s2> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p18_b10> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/368730008> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s2> .
