<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p70_b10> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image displays a histological section stained with hematoxylin and eosin (H&E). The cells are arranged in a dense, interconnected network, with nuclei appearing dark blue and cytoplasm stained pink. A black line extends from the left side of the image towards the center-right, pointing to a specific area within the tissue. Another black line is located at the top right corner, extending horizontally across the upper part of the image. A third black line is positioned on the far right side, pointing to an area near the edge of the image." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s2> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/25bfa0683524> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#regulates> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s2> .
