<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p44_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "A flowchart illustrating the hormonal pathway from the hypothalamus to the mammary glands, involving the pituitary gland and the hormones DA, TRH, and PRL." <urn:graph:endocrine/s8> .
