<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p2_b5> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "A large, irregularly shaped bone dominates the image, rendered in light yellow with smooth, curved lines that reflect its natural contours. The bone has a broad, flat upper section that narrows towards the lower part. A blue circular area is centrally positioned within the upper section of the bone, highlighting a specific part of the femoral head. The background is light beige with subtle, wavy, off-white lines that curve and flow, adding a decorative element without obscuring the main subject. There are no labels, text, or arrows present, keeping the focus solely on the anatomical illustration of the femur." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s3> .
