<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p19_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the anatomical structures of the human pharynx and its surrounding areas, including the nasal cavity, various folds, tonsils, and the different sections of the pharynx." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s8> .
