<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p25_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The illustration is divided into three sections. The left section presents a side view of the pharynx and surrounding muscles, with labels \"S,\" \"M,\" and \"I\" for the muscles. An arrow points to the pharyngeal raphe, and the esophagus is shown at the bottom. The middle section offers a cross-sectional view of the pharynx, with the nasopharynx, oropharynx, and laryngopharynx in different shades of red. The right section provides a more detailed view of the pharynx and surrounding structures, again labeling the nasopharynx, oropharynx, and laryngopharynx. Each section is labeled with \"GAS Fig.\" followed by a number." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s8> .
