<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p21_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the detailed anatomy of the human pharynx and surrounding structures, including the pharyngeal tonsil, choanae, nasal septum, parotid gland, nasopharynx, inferior nasal concha, soft palate, submandibular gland, uvula, palatine tonsil, root of the tongue, epiglottis, oropharynx, laryngopharynx, esophagus, and trachea." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s8> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p24_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/263376008> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s8> .
