<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p51_b11> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image presents a side profile of a human head and neck with a semi-transparent overlay highlighting the facial nerves and glands. The facial nerve is labeled near the ear, pointing to the area behind it. The parotid gland is labeled near the cheek, slightly below the ear. The submandibular gland is labeled near the lower jaw, and the sublingual gland is labeled near the chin. The background is white, providing a clear contrast for the anatomical features." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s8> .
