<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p51_b11> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "A side view of a human head and neck with labeled anatomical structures, including the facial nerve, parotid gland, submandibular gland, and sublingual gland." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s8> .
