<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p68_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image displays a cross-section of glandular tissue, stained with hematoxylin and eosin, which highlights the structural components of the tissue." <urn:graph:histology_endocrine/s6> .
