<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p65_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the detailed anatomy of the neck, including muscles, nerves, blood vessels, and other structures." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s3> .
