<http://example.org/medkg/inst/assert/ce5bc747d5c6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#about> <http://snomed.info/id/72260008> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s3> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p13_b9> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the nerves and blood vessels in the neck region, including cranial nerves IX and X, the superior and middle cervical ganglia, and various arteries and plexuses." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s3> .
<http://snomed.info/id/230690007> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caused_by> <http://snomed.info/id/64586002> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_neck/s3> .
