<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p67_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The flowchart is organized with a blue rectangular box labeled \"Sensory input\" on the left side, connected by an arrow to a box labeled \"Suckling\" directly below it. At the top center, a green rectangular box reads \"Hypothalamus,\" from which two arrows extend downward to the \"Posterior pituitary\" and \"Anterior pituitary\" boxes. The \"Posterior pituitary\" box is pink and is positioned below the hypothalamus, with an arrow leading downward to a pink box labeled \"Oxytocin.\" Another arrow extends from the \"Oxytocin\" box to a pink box labeled \"Milk ejection.\" To the right of the hypothalamus, the \"Anterior pituitary\" box is also pink, with an arrow pointing downward to a pink box labeled \"Prolactin,\" which in turn has an arrow leading to a box labeled \"Milk production.\"" <urn:graph:endocrine/s9> .
