<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p38_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The graph illustrates the fluctuating levels of growth hormone in the bloodstream over a 24-hour period, with peaks labeled \"Strenuous exercise\" occurring around noon and midnight." <urn:graph:endocrine/s9> .
