<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p87_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure shows a microscopic view of liver tissue, highlighting endothelial cells, the central vein, bile canaliculi, hepatic plates, and sinusoids." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s1> .
