<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p76_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The liver is shown in a reddish-brown color, with the right lobe positioned at the upper right and the left lobe at the lower left. The diaphragm is depicted above the liver, labeled at the top of the image. The gallbladder, a small green teardrop-shaped organ, is located below the liver, labeled at the bottom center." <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s20> .
