<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p59_b11> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The illustration features a central figure of a male, shown from the waist up, wearing a white T-shirt and black shorts. Dashed lines extend from different parts of his body and face, indicating specific symptoms. A line points to the forehead for fever, near the temples for headache, and near the jawline for swollen parotid salivary glands. Another line points to the bicep area for sore muscles, near the eyes for tiredness, and to the lower abdomen for swelling and pain in the testicles. The text \"Mumps symptoms\" is written at the bottom left corner of the image." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s9> .
