<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p6_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure presents a detailed anatomical illustration of the human brain, including both the cerebral hemispheres and the lower parts of the brainstem." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_endocrine_glands/s9> .
