<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p5_b5> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image is a table with two columns and six rows. The first column is labeled \"Single bones,\" and the second column is labeled \"Paired bones.\" In the \"Single bones\" column, the first row contains the word \"Vomer,\" and the second row contains the word \"Mandible.\" The third to fifth rows in this column are empty. In the \"Paired bones\" column, the first row contains the word \"Maxillary,\" the second row has \"Palatine,\" the third row has \"Zygomatic,\" the fourth row has \"Lacrimal,\" the fifth row has \"Nasal,\" and the sixth row has \"Inferior nasal conchae.\" The table has a white background with black text and is neatly organized with clear separation between the columns and rows." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s2> .
