<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/e7f6a7e5544d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s18> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p55_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the normal anatomical relationship and the changes in the aortomesenteric angle and duodenum in the context of superior mesenteric artery syndrome." <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s18> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p37_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/120576005> <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s18> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/9c3d43f87e01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s18> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p55_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image presents two diagrams side by side, each labeled at the top. The left diagram is labeled \"Normal,\" and the right diagram is labeled \"Superior mesenteric artery syndrome.\" In both diagrams, the aorta is positioned at the top and is depicted as a large, pinkish-red tube-like structure extending vertically. Below the aorta, the superior mesenteric artery is shown as a smaller, pinkish-red tube-like structure branching off. In the \"Normal\" diagram, the superior mesenteric artery is clearly visible and separate from the aorta, while in the \"Superior mesenteric artery syndrome\" diagram, it appears compressed or narrowed. In the \"Normal\" diagram, this angle is open and clear, whereas in the \"Superior mesenteric artery syndrome\" diagram, it appears constricted. The duodenum is positioned below the aortomesenteric angle in both diagrams, depicted as a pinkish-red tube-like structure extending downward. In the \"Normal\" diagram, the duodenum is clearly visible and separate, while in the \"Superior mesenteric artery syndrome\" diagram, it appears compressed or narrowed near the aortomesenteric angle." <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s18> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/6c12bf618baf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s18> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/e7f6a7e5544d> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#extractedBy> "llm-re" <urn:graph:abdominal_wall/s18> .
