<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p25_b5> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image features a detailed anatomical illustration with the fetal head positioned at the top-center, depicted as a dark, round shape. The pelvic floor muscles are shown in red, while the perineal area is highlighted in white. The labels are connected to specific parts using black lines or arrows. The medio lateral episiotomy is shown as cuts made laterally on either side of the median episiotomy. The anus and the external anal sphincter are also labeled, with the external anal sphincter surrounding the anal opening." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s9> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p20_b8> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/244972001> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s9> .
