<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p32_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the pelvic floor muscles and related structures, including the rectal hiatus, vaginal canal, urethral hiatus, pre-rectal fibers, puborectalis, pubococcygeus, iliococcygeus, and coccygeus muscles." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s9> .
