<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p45_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/49475008> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s6> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p24_b12> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates a side view of a human skull with two distinct muscle groups highlighted in shades of pink and red." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s6> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p25_b10> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/118630004> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s6> .
