<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p36_b2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#FigureImage> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s6> .
