<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p21_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the structure of the pituitary gland and its relationship with the hypothalamus, including the various lobes and internal components." <urn:graph:histology_endocrine/s3> .
