<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p43_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The figure is divided into three sections. The top section features a detailed diagram with labeled parts, including lacunae, cementum, canaliculi, interglobular space, dentin matrix, dentin tubules, and a granular layer. The middle section displays a microscopic image of a tissue sample stained in pink and purple, divided into distinct layers. The bottom right section showcases an animated unicorn doctor character with orange hair, a golden horn, and a white lab coat, standing against a light blue background with a teal wave design at the bottom." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s9> .
