<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p18_b11> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image features adipocytes in the upper left, marked by a dashed outline, appearing as large, round cells with a pale pinkish hue. Transverse fibers stretch horizontally across the upper central area, while vertical fibers run from bottom to top in the lower central region. Longitudinal fibers are positioned in the lower left and right, extending from left to right. Nerves are highlighted in the upper right corner, indicated by a label pointing to a cluster of small, darkly stained structures. The background consists of densely packed fibers with varying orientations and lighter areas suggesting connective tissue and possible blood vessels." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s9> .
