<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/64540bd153c5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s7> .
