<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p10_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the anatomical profile of the head, highlighting key facial muscles such as the frontalis, corrugator, nasalis, orbicularis oculi, and levator labii." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s3> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p11_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/71616004> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s3> .
