<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p65_b12> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The illustration features a light beige background with a textured appearance. Muscles and glands are rendered in shades of pink, blue, and brown, with black lines delineating their boundaries and connections. The tongue is positioned at the top left, while the sublingual gland is situated near the bottom of the tongue. The supramylohyoid portion of the submandibular space is located above the mylohyoid muscle, and the inframylohyoid portion is below it. The submandibular gland is placed beneath the mylohyoid muscle, and the digastric muscle (anterior belly) is depicted as a V-shaped muscle below the submandibular gland." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s3> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/4cd32cb0960f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#subject> <http://snomed.info/id/35201009> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_face_and_oral_cavity/s3> .
