<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p12_b7> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image presents two anatomical illustrations placed side by side. Each illustration focuses on the abdominal cavity, with various structures labeled. The labels indicate the structures' positions relative to the peritoneum, helping to distinguish between intraperitoneal and extraperitoneal organs. The side-by-side arrangement allows for comparison between the two depictions, highlighting differences in structural labeling." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s7> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/7c5fceb2bace> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s7> .
