<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p14_b3> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the anatomy of the abdominal and pelvic regions, highlighting the digestive and urinary systems across four separate diagrams." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s7> .
