<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p61_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The flowchart has a horizontal layout with a central blue oval labeled \"Release of vasopressin.\" Various text labels are positioned around the oval: \"Stress\" and \"Trauma and injury (including surgery)\" are on the left, \"Increased osmotic pressure of blood\" is at the top-left, \"Decreased blood volume\" is at the top-right, \"Decreased oxygen content of the blood\" is below \"Decreased blood volume,\" and \"Increased carbon dioxide content of blood\" is at the bottom-right. Red arrows connect these labels to the central oval, indicating the factors that lead to the release of vasopressin." <urn:graph:endocrine/s7> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/176b4fa409bc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:endocrine/s7> .
