<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p18_b9> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The mons pubis is positioned at the top of the diagram, with the labia majora and labia minora surrounding the clitoris and urethral opening. The vaginal orifice is situated below the urethral orifice, and the overall layout is symmetrical, reflecting a typical human female genital configuration." <urn:graph:anatomy_of_pelvic_floor/s8> .
