<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p43_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the immune response within the gut mucosa, showing various components such as the gut lumen, epithelial layer, Peyer's patch, and mesenteric lymph node." <urn:graph:digestive_system/s7> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/assert/1ff5963e225b> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#target> <http://snomed.info/id/113343008> <urn:graph:digestive_system/s7> .
