<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p47_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "A graph displays two sets of data over a 24-hour period, marked by intervals such as Noon, 4 PM, 8 PM, Midnight, 4 AM, 8 AM, and Noon again. A solid black line represents Plasma ACTH, and a dashed red line represents Plasma 11-OHCS. The x-axis is labeled with \"Lunch,\" \"Snack,\" \"Dinner,\" \"Snack,\" \"Sleep,\" and \"Breakfast\" corresponding to their times. A shaded area under the \"Sleep\" label indicates a period of rest." <urn:graph:endocrine/s4> .
