<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p16_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#caption> "The figure illustrates the feedback control mechanisms within the endocrine system, showing the interactions between the hypothalamus, pituitary gland, and peripheral glands." <urn:graph:endocrine/s4> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p56_b1> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/62818001> <urn:graph:endocrine/s4> .
