<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p15_b4> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/69695003> <urn:graph:digestive_system/s8> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/assert/921b4d5458bb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#ClinicalAssertion> <urn:graph:digestive_system/s8> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p15_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The flowchart is composed of blue rectangular boxes connected by arrows. The first box, positioned at the top-left, reads \"Smell, sight, though of food\" and has no incoming arrows. Directly below it is a box that says \"Activate neurons in medulla oblongata,\" connected by an arrow from the first box. Beneath this is another box reading \"Sends an efferent signal,\" linked by an arrow from the previous box. Two arrows extend downward from this third box: one to the left towards a box labeled \"Salivary glands\" and another to the right towards a box labeled \"ENS\" (Enteric Nervous System). The left arrow is labeled with \"neurons\" and \"Trough autonomic,\" while the right arrow is labeled with \"nerves\" and \"Trough vagus.\"" <urn:graph:digestive_system/s8> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/a5ee992ef8e2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#subject> <http://snomed.info/id/66787007> <urn:graph:digestive_system/s8> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/42b2cfa5ca4b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#connects_to> <urn:graph:digestive_system/s8> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p7_b7> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The diagram features several elongated, oval-shaped structures resembling muscle cells, colored light pink with darker pink outlines. Each cell has a central purple area, likely representing the nucleus. Thin, wavy gray lines labeled \"VARICOSITIES (SYNAPTIC CONTACTS)\" extend from these cells, marked with small yellow dots along their length, indicating neurotransmitter release sites. At the bottom, a caption in black text reads, \"ISOLATED CELLS ALLOW FINER MOTOR CONTROL.\"" <urn:graph:digestive_system/s8> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/a5ee992ef8e2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#part_of> <urn:graph:digestive_system/s8> .
