<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p66_b6> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/12710003> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s3> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p66_b5> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#depicts> <http://snomed.info/id/61001002> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s3> .
<http://example.org/medkg/inst/stmt/42c2f1f65e2e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s3> .
