<http://example.org/medkg/inst/fig/p73_b2> <http://example.org/medkg/ont#visualDescription> "The image displays a histological section with a dense network of acinar structures scattered throughout, interspersed with spaces and larger rounded structures. The top left corner features an ID label pointing to the left side, while labels A, S, and M are distributed across the image, highlighting different components. The H&E staining gives the tissue a pinkish hue, with darker nuclei due to the staining process." <urn:graph:histology_digestive_1/s3> .
